    "en": {
      "trackName": "Lullroll",
      "description": "Lullroll is a maze game for Apple Watch built for the short pockets of the day when you just need to breathe and unplug for a minute.\n\nEach level is generated on the fly: you never see the same maze twice. Tilt your watch to move the ball, or use touch gestures depending on your model. When you finish, another maze is already waiting — no loading screens, no ads.\n\nFeatures\n• Procedural mazes with multiple algorithms (Backtracker, Kruskal, Prim, Wilson, Division).\n• Tilt control with built-in calibration, or touch gestures.\n• Local stats: time, moves, completed levels.\n• Unlockable achievements.\n• No sound, no network, no account. Everything stays on your watch.\n\nMade for Apple Watch (watchOS 26.4 or later).",
